From 86680818c37c0936af44864ed8780b6ea81c3af3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paulo Ricardo <contact@pauloricardo.dev>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 14:15:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] feat(openwebui): hide raw Ollama base models and expose
 only custom presets

- Apply patch-model-visibility.py to OpenWebUI main.py endpoint /api/models
- Configure OPENWEBUI_HIDDEN_BASE_MODEL_IDS in compose.yaml to hide all 10 raw Ollama base models
- Keep base models accessible internally for RAG, embedding and custom presets
- Update openwebui-config.test.js assertions to accept OpenWebUI v0.11.4
- Rebuild codebase-memory-open-webui and restart service (77/77 tests passing)
